  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SMURFIT KAPPA FOUNDATION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This  phase of the project continues to strengthen the local and sustainable economic development of the rural areas of the Nima River Basin in the municipality of Palmira. This will contribute to the diversification of income sources and the creation of employment for women and young people in the territory. It will also ensure the conservation of the cultural, natural environment, its biodiversity and ecosystem services with actions to help implement nature community tourism in the Nima Touristic Corridor.</narrative>
  </description>
